Trotem
$cards
DECK 1 {SPADES, CLUBS}

$initial
AQA 3 FACE_ALL
AQA 6 FACE_ALL
AQA 8 FACE_ALL
AQA 5 FACE_ALL
AQA 4 FACE_ALL

$moves
MOVE AQA AQA
OR
    DEST Suit {CLUBS}
    AND
        DESTSRC Rank ascending
        DEST Rank 1
$win
OR
    AND
        PILE ALL AQA Empty
        PILE ALL AQA Empty
    AND
        PILE ALL AQA Empty
        PILE ALL AQA Empty
